architecture-audit/continuous-improvement/2026-05-24-arch-002-decision-conformance-refresh.md:12:- The implementation log records that `ProjectService` moved to schema `4.0.0`, provenance metadata, reducer snapshot capture/restore, validation, and runtime command-history clearing (`architecture-audit/implementation-log/ARCH-002.md:9`). It also records backend rejection of legacy flat/command update fields (`architecture-audit/implementation-log/ARCH-002.md:15`) and focused tests for no command-history serialization, runtime-only restore, old command-stream rejection, and private-stack validation (`architecture-audit/implementation-log/ARCH-002.md:16`, `architecture-audit/implementation-log/ARCH-002.md:17`).
architecture-audit/continuous-improvement/2026-05-24-arch-002-decision-conformance-refresh.md:19:Frontend persistence still exposes one `ProjectData` shape with `schemaVersion: '4.0.0'`, typed provenance, and a `domain: ProjectStateRecord` field (`frontend/src/services/ProjectService.ts:17`, `frontend/src/services/ProjectService.ts:25`, `frontend/src/services/ProjectService.ts:28`, `frontend/src/services/ProjectService.ts:29`). Snapshot creation clones and freezes the provided reducer record and writes provenance with `contract: 'current-snapshot'` (`frontend/src/services/ProjectService.ts:47`, `frontend/src/services/ProjectService.ts:56`, `frontend/src/services/ProjectService.ts:59`, `frontend/src/services/ProjectService.ts:61`, `frontend/src/services/ProjectService.ts:65`).
architecture-audit/continuous-improvement/2026-05-24-arch-002-decision-conformance-refresh.md:21:The reducer DTO itself is still the current plain record authority: `ProjectStateRecord` carries `schemaVersion` (`frontend/src/domain/world/ProjectState.ts:21`, `frontend/src/domain/world/ProjectState.ts:22`), `emptyProjectState()` initializes version `4.0.0` (`frontend/src/domain/world/ProjectState.ts:157`, `frontend/src/domain/world/ProjectState.ts:159`), and `createProjectStateRecord()` rejects class instances instead of copying them into the DTO (`frontend/src/domain/world/ProjectState.ts:235`, `frontend/src/domain/world/ProjectState.ts:238`, `frontend/src/domain/world/ProjectState.ts:241`).
