architecture-audit/final-review/00-summary.md:4:Final acceptance is **met for the architecture-overhaul cycle**. The Phase B register marks `ARCH-001` through `ARCH-012` resolved in `architecture-audit/issues/register.md:1`; the implementation evidence in `architecture-audit/implementation-log/ARCH-001.md:1` through `architecture-audit/implementation-log/ARCH-012.md:1` is cross-checked below against current source, deletion evidence, validation logs, and no-backcompat leakage checks. Current source remains the authority: root workspace scripts are in `package.json:10`, live frontend state authority is `frontend/src/domain/world/ProjectState.ts:1` plus `frontend/src/domain/world/ProjectStateRuntime.ts:1`, backend contracts are in `backend/src/api/projects.ts:1`, and current e2e contracts are `frontend/tests/e2e/current-ui-contract.spec.ts:1` plus `frontend/tests/e2e/current-persistence-contract.spec.ts:1`.
