architecture-audit/final-review/00-summary.md:52:- Legacy command-stream names appear only as rejection keys/tests (`frontend/src/services/ProjectService.ts:36`, `backend/src/api/projects.ts:24`, `frontend/tests/e2e/current-persistence-contract.spec.ts:67`) or private runtime history fields (`frontend/src/commands/CommandStack.ts:11`), not as persistence compatibility.
